{"t": 1794124082.7018778, "kind": "call", "tool": "sentry_update_issue", "args": {"issueId": "PAYMENTS-API-3K", "organizationSlug": "acme", "reason": "Root cause verified from the Sentry event: apply_discount subtracts amount_cents=None for expired coupons. Implemented a local fix in payments/discounts.py: expired coupons and missing/null amounts leave total unchanged; valid discounts are floored at zero. Added tests/test_discounts.py with 10 cases covering the exact event, expired/missing/null/zero/normal/exact/oversized discounts and input non-mutation. Before fix: 7 failed, 3 passed. After fix: python -m pytest -q => 10 passed; compileall passed. Marking resolved in next release, not claiming production recovery: the workspace has no Git metadata, GitHub source lookups/search returned empty results, and no deployment or remote publication could be verified. Jira searches for this issue/apply_discount and coupon/discount found no matching tickets. The local patch still needs publication and deployment, followed by production verification.", "status": "resolvedInNextRelease"}, "ok": true}
